{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《中年好聲音4》的台灣參賽者吳亦偉，憑着出色的唱功深受觀眾與歌迷喜愛。近日，吳亦偉在香港舉辦了首個粉絲見面會，向來親民的他更化身「型男廚神」，親自走入廚房大展身手煮美食，慰勞一班支持他的歌迷。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"599033d4-6547-44f3-b381-1a2d4b91165d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026J5JSBqSsQ01789440273.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"599033d4-6547-44f3-b381-1a2d4b91165d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e2417e9203b7099b-2256\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>吳亦偉事後在社交平台大晒多張活動花絮相片，見他下廚有姿態兼有實際，端出色香味俱全的「豬肉炒糯米椒」、「辣炒海瓜子」及「清炒奶油白菜」等幾道美味菜式，讓到場的粉絲大飽口福。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e2417e9203b7099b-2256\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e2417e9203b7099b-2257\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>難得在香港親自下廚，吳亦偉感性又興奮地留言透露：「來到香港比賽一年了，都沒有地方可以讓我煮菜。第一次的粉絲見面會，就滿足一下我，可以自己煮菜😂。」除了借見面會滿足自己的下廚癮，他更特別感謝歌迷帶他體驗香港在地生活：「也謝謝你們還帶著我去『街市』走走，讓我感受一下，超級無敵開心，希望你們玩得很開心！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e2417e9203b7099b-2257\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5cf917db-fd80-4f84-b126-42c9bf930626.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XRT1uhGB8K1789440273.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5cf917db-fd80-4f84-b126-42c9bf930626.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"75d78244-5213-46ff-a3c7-436b4f5d76c3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265HSG8G6i8t1789440272.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"75d78244-5213-46ff-a3c7-436b4f5d76c3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e2417e9203b7099b-2258\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>面對歌迷的支持，吳亦偉亦不忘展現細心溫暖的一面。由於今次活動籌備時間緊湊，他對於未能讓更多歌迷到場感到非常不好意思，主動致歉並向大家許下承諾：「我也要跟大家不好意思，這次辦得太倉促，好多人都沒有參與到，我答應大家～下一次會找大一點的地方跟大家見面聊聊天，謝謝😊。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:20:33.190520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":466,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}